# Start: SAVES FOLDER on-screen keyboard, holding the current value.
# START submits once and closes the keyboard. An unchanged value is a
# no-op on every backend: no provider probe, path write or file transfer.
# End: CLOUD hub, CHANGE CLOUD FOLDER focused, after leaving CLOUD FOLDERS.
# The result frame is the three-row selector, not a provider outcome (#527).
key ret
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
shot folder-result
key z
wait-for-change
settle
shot after-dismiss
